# One of Rowan's morph forms in a session: B casts, A sees B as that creature and is not morphed itself, and both of B's
# attack keys wound the shared ripper on A's machine too. The morph keeps running: morph_coop_end.part ends it.
# The ripper pack fights back: a press is retried while the creature is stunned.
# Parameters: form, body, reach, reach2, gap, secondary (as in morph_form.part), ripper (guid of the shared target).

B run adjusthealth 1000
B xp mark
B expect useitem mage_morph_$form 0.3 idle contains "used mage_morph_$form" timeout=20
B expect morph contains "body=$body" timeout=10
B expect mage_morph contains "buffed=1" timeout=5
# The morph itself pays no experience, only kills do.
B expect xp gained == 0
B invincible on
A expect actors 800 contains "Morph" timeout=10
A expect morph == morphed=0

A tpnear $ripper 120 0
A expect near $ripper 1000 contains "loaded" timeout=15
set key PrimaryAttack
set at $reach
include morph_coop_attack.part
set key $secondary
set at $reach2
include morph_coop_attack.part
